/F1 15 Tf
(SUPERR SELECTOR 2027 - METHODOLOGY REPORT) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf
(Purpose: Rank batters and bowlers for IPL 2027 auction scouting using) Tj
T*
(overall situation performance and performance under pressure.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. DATA SCOPE) Tj
T*
(IPL and T20I supplied datasets from 2022 onward. Batting and format-specific) Tj
T*
(bowling use source CSVs. Combined IPL + T20I bowling uses Excel-derived) Tj
T*
(economy rankings and defending-pressure reference tables.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. SITUATION SCORE \(50% OF FINAL\)) Tj
T*
(Batting: strike rate in powerplay, middle and death overs, setting or chasing.) Tj
T*
(All eligible batter-faced deliveries are used, not only pressure deliveries.) Tj
T*
(Weights: PP setting x2 / chasing x4; middle x1 / x2; death x3 / x6.) Tj
T*
(Weighted strike-rate band points are normalized from 180 to 100.) Tj
T*
(Bowling: economy percentiles in the same three phases, bowling first x2) Tj
T*
(and defending x4. Lower economy is better. Original Excel-derived) Tj
T*
(weighted points /180 are normalized to 100 for combined format.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. PRESSURE SCORE \(50% OF FINAL\)) Tj
T*
(Batting: difficult chase from over 7 \(RRR >= 9 and RRR > CRR\), early) Tj
T*
(collapse \(3+ wickets lost in first 10 overs\), death overs \(16-20\),) Tj
T*
(or knockout. Overlapping conditions count once in combined pressure.) Tj
T*
(Bowling: defending when chasing team's pre-delivery CRR > RRR.) Tj
T*
(Pressure economy and improvement versus chase economy are evaluated.) Tj
T*
(Only positive economy improvement earns bowling improvement credit.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Pressure score /100 = 60% pressure-situation performance) Tj
T*
(                       + 40% overall pressure reliability.) Tj
T*
(Batting reliability considers pressure SR and improvement versus overall SR.) Tj
T*
(Bowling reliability considers pressure economy and improvement.) Tj
T*
(Small samples are adjusted toward 50 using confidence = balls/\(balls+60\).) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
