(SUPERR SELECTOR 2027 - METHODOLOGY \(CONTINUED\)) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf
() Tj
T*
(4. FINAL COMPOSITE SCORE) Tj
T*
(Composite score /200 = Situation score /100 + Pressure score /100.) Tj
T*
(Thus situation and pressure each contribute 50% of the final ranking.) Tj
T*
(Players are ranked in descending composite score; pressure balls and) Tj
T*
(name are used as tie-breakers where specified.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. SAMPLE REQUIREMENTS AND ASSUMPTIONS) Tj
T*
(Default: at least 9 matches and 100 pressure balls; minimum 20 balls) Tj
T*
(per pressure situation for situation-specific points. User-adjustable) Tj
T*
(thresholds may change the eligible player pool and ranking.) Tj
T*
(Missing or insufficient situation-pressure samples earn no such points.) Tj
T*
(Pakistan/Bangladesh exclusions are optional. Retirement and selected) Tj
T*
(retained-player exclusions are applied; auction availability is not) Tj
T*
(independently established by these flags.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Assumptions: supplied match, phase and delivery fields are consistent;) Tj
T*
(run rates are estimates; score bands, percentiles and weights are) Tj
T*
(scouting-model choices. Percentile results depend on the eligible pool.) Tj
T*
(Excel-derived combined bowling values use the reference workbooks;) Tj
T*
(the excluded-chases audit supports bowling pressure diagnostics.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6. INTERPRETATION AND LIMITATIONS) Tj
T*
(The full model is NOT restricted to pressure balls. The base half uses) Tj
T*
(all eligible deliveries; the pressure half uses defined pressure samples.) Tj
T*
(Final 50/50 and internal pressure 60/40 are different weighting levels.) Tj
T*
(Rankings indicate relative performance, not causal clutch ability or) Tj
T*
(guaranteed auction availability. Consider role fit, squad balance,) Tj
T*
(fitness, price and verified auction eligibility before final decisions.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Deliverables: Batters, Bowlers and Methodology dashboard pages;) Tj
T*
(top-10 shortlists; and this written methodology report.) Tj
T*
ET
